1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,950
The form.

2
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:08,476
Fourteen lines, which is why your exercises call it a sonnet, but there is no regular metre and no sonnet rhyme scheme.

3
00:00:08,476 --> 00:00:15,286
Instead, seven rhyming couplets: a a, b b, c c, and so on.

4
00:00:15,286 --> 00:00:24,036
The couplets are the argument: pairs of lines that answer one another, until the last couplet names the idea: may our lives rhyme.

